'''Project A''' (巨匠 ''Kyoshō'', '''Master''') is a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant of [[Master A.]] that appears in [[Cats of the Cosmos]], [[The Aku Realms]], and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]].

