==Trivia==
*His design resembles the [[wikia:aliens:Xenomorph|Xenomorph]] from ''[[wikipedia:Alien: Covenant|Alien: Covenant]]'', as seen from his head and his back.
*He is the only [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemy whose Japanese name contains no kana whatsoever.
*Even though his and Master A.'s Japanese names can both be translated as "Master", they aren't quite the same: Project A is 巨匠 ''Kyoshō'', meaning "master of an art/craft", while Master A. is 師匠 ''Shishō'', which is closer to "instructor".

